# Linux CI subset for GitHub Actions on Python 3.11.
# Keep this file separate from the local CUDA profile in requirements.txt.
# Refresh ci.lock.txt from Linux only (native Linux or a python:3.11 container).
# A lock generated on Windows misses Ubuntu-specific torch dependencies and breaks
# `python -m pip install --require-hashes --only-binary=:all:` in CI.

